# Wallapop CDP workers (plan only)

One Wallapop **account**. Several **workers**, each with **its own chrome.exe and CDP port**. Do **not** collapse into one Chrome.

Do **not** implement **sold** (C8, take-down) until the operator confirms the live Wallapop DOM (open the item URL, then the sold control). Guessing selectors is not allowed.

## Workers (now)

1. **Monitor** — not built. Chrome stays up.
2. **Publish** — port **9222**, profile `ChromeCDP-Persistent`. **Look at the SKU first** (title vs Tu Catálogo). Do not post a duplicate; Wallapop Follow-up may delete it after Yuhu. After Publicar: grab first `tsl-catalog-item` `/item/` href immediately (DOM under Yuhu), then dismiss «Ahora no, gracias». Then quit **this** chrome.exe.
3. **Sold** (C8, not built) — own port. After the job: quit **that** chrome.exe. Needs a saved public `/item/…` URL.

Later: AI chat worker.

## After a job (chosen)

- **Publish / sold:** close the job tab, then **quit that worker’s chrome.exe**.
- **Monitor:** do not quit.
